5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried the diggers will mess up the schedule again. Has anyone checked if the ground here is actually ready for them?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Kenji, the ground is rarely ready for anyone. I suspect the real issue is whether the plan respects the existing drainage and foot traffic patterns.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder who will water the new plants every single day? It seems like a very big job for just one person.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Minato, that’s a valid operational concern. But I’m more interested in the long-term durability of the structures. Has anyone reviewed the condition of works from the earlier programme?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Minako, that’s a fair point. I’m mostly curious about the upkeep ledger spend per hectare to see what the real long-term cost might be.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, drainage is key, but I’m still stuck on the timeline. @Minako, did you find anything scary in those old works?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, timelines are often fiction. @Minako, I haven’t seen the data yet, but I suspect the old works are a cautionary tale about ignoring reality.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think the people who care for the park are very important. I want to know who will be there every day.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the daily care is vital. I’m focusing on the physical decay of past projects. @Kenji, I’ll check the condition of the earlier works.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, the daily care is indeed vital. I’m looking into the groundskeeping roll to understand the staffing reality behind those costs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, that sounds serious. I’m going to check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving to see if they’re reliable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll examine the drainage callouts and August heat readings. If the ground drowns or bakes, no amount of paperwork saves us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look into the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I want to see who is actually there to help.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll review the condition of works from the earlier programme and the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll check the terms of the regional habitat fund and the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, I hope your drainage check helps. I’m really hoping the earth-moving firms are solid so we don’t get stuck in the mud again.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, mud is just water with poor manners. I’ll see if the ground can handle the heat and the rain before we worry about the diggers.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the volunteers are kind. I will look at the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups to see who helps.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
