66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the fund covers the planting, but the city pays the triple upkeep. We must ensure the ledger doesn’t break us later.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, I worry about the reeds. Will the volunteers have to cut them every day? I hope they can just sit and watch the water.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, reeds need seasonal cutting, not daily labor. But the cost gap is real. We must weigh the habitat fund’s help against the city’s long-term burden.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, the fund covers the planting, but the city pays the triple upkeep. We must ensure the ledger doesn’t break us later.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
