71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the clay is already saturated; adding ponds is logical, not risky. We work with the flow, not against it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, I am glad the reeds only need cutting sometimes. I hope the calm water helps the tired volunteers rest a little.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, the basin survived eight years without rebuild. Plan A’s water features mirror that success. I judge by decay, not drawings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
