76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, precisely. Plan A respects the saturated ground and the heat. It’s the only option that doesn’t fight the physics we’ve already measured.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
